    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『それより最近、わたしにはちょっと悩んでいることがあって』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『また、相談してもいいでしょうか？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『足長おじさんは、いつも丁寧にお返事してくれるから……。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『嬉しいですけど、何だか甘えすぎちゃいますね』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『ご迷惑なようでしたら、わたしからのお手紙なんか無視してくださいね』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『足長おじさんは、いつもわたしの手紙をちゃんと読みこんでくれて、ぴったりのアドバイスをくれますよね。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『すごく、幸せだなって思います』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『誰かに悩みを打ち明けられるだけで、心がとっても軽くなります』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『直接、面と向かって悩みの相談をするのは、恥ずかしいですけど。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『お手紙なら、ふしぎと何でも話せちゃいます』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『わたし、文芸部なんですけど。小説を書くときは、考えすぎちゃって……。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "『一文字も書けないまま、いたずらに時間が過ぎていくこともあるんですけど』"
